~ den_filler
% => convo_1
% => convo_2
% => convo_3
% => convo_4
% => convo_5
=> END


~ convo_1
Az: Where are you from?
Fenn: Navetta!
Az: Hm. Never heard of it. Where is it?
Fenn: It's north. Lots of trees and farms and stuff.
Az: Ah, the countryside?
Fenn: Yeah! Not a lot of people... to talk to.
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-1-Az-Den", true)
=> END

~ convo_2
Fenn: Have you met Adira? Knight of Cloth? She's my favorite Knight. She's so cool!!!!
Az: Adira? Yikes...
Fenn: Why? What? What's wrong with Adira?
Az: I mean...nothing... if you don't mind Knights who are shallow, conceited, pieces of-
Fenn: WHAT?!
Az: Sorry to break it to you, kid. Adira is... kinda terrible.
Fenn: Really?
Az: Hey, don't worry about it. Most of 'em are fine. Adira specifically is terrible.
Fenn: Oh. Aw...
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-2-Az-Den", true)
=> END

~ convo_3
Az: How come you seem to know a lot about the Knights and stuff?
Fenn: Who wouldn't want to know about the knights? They're the coolest!
Az: I dunno. I've never seen someone so enthusiastic about them.
Fenn: But they do so many awesome things! They go on adventures! Slay monsters! Save princesses!
Az: Fenn, I don't think there's been a princess that needed saving in, like, at least a century
Fenn: But... but...
Az: Nah. Don't worry. I get it.
Az: I remember when Baba became a Knight. It was pretty cool.
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-3-Az-Den", true)
=> END

~ convo_4
Fenn: Do you make a lot of bracelet things?
Az: Bangles?
Fenn: Yeah! Bracelet things.
Az: No, not often. These ones took me weeks to get the inscriptions just right.
Az: If I want something for my wrists, I usually make stuff with yarn or beads
Fenn: REALLY?! Could I have one?
Az: Uh, yeah, I guess. They're in my room, though.
Fenn: YAY! I can't wait.
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-4-Az-Den", true)
=> END

~ convo_5
Az: Alright, let's go. We've got a wizard to deal with.
#do EventFlags.set_flag("F-5-Az-Den", true)
=> END
